        "Map out a Diploma year connected to Hisar and four dates matter most: the first internal exams soon after Class 11 starts, Internal Assessment deadlines scattered through Class 12, predicted grades needed that autumn for applications, and mocks in the weeks before May itself. Get moving in April or July of Class 11 and there's still time to fix real gaps before any of those dates arrive.",
